@startuml Provider Registration - Activity Diagram
!theme plain
title Provider Registration & Verification (Simplified)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F3E5F5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF9C4

start

:Step 1: Upload dokumen\n(KTP, foto, selfie);
:Step 2: Pilih keahlian & harga;
:Step 3: Review;
:Step 4: Isi data diri & password;

|Admin|
if (Lengkap & valid?) then (ya)
  :Setujui → "Terverifikasi";
else (tidak)
  :Tolak + alasan;
  |Provider|
  :Perbaiki & ajukan ulang;
  stop
endif

|Provider|
:Lengkapi profil & payout method;
:Mulai kerja;

stop
@enduml
